  "description": "Demolition of existing garage and store and the erection of a single-storey rear extension and change of use of existing ground floor retail unit into one-bedroom self-contained flat, and conversion of existing roof space incorporating the installation of two roof-light windows to provide a habitable room for the existing first floor flat.",
