  "lapsed_date": "04/01/2009",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 3 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the alterations and extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 4 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 5 - The car parking accommodation shown on drawing No. PW3 shall be provided before the dwelling to which it relates is occupied and thereafter it shall not be used for any purpose other than the parking of vehicles and shall be permanently retained.",
    "Condition : 6 - No additional flank windows or other glazed openings shall be formed in the flank walls of the extension hereby approved without the prior written consent of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 7 - The roof area of the extension hereby permitted shall not be used as a balcony, roof garden or similar amenity area without the grant of further specific permission from the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 8 - The proposal would not result in the loss of an essential local shopping facility and would provide an adequate standard of living accommodation. With appropriate safeguarding conditions the proposal would not result in a loss of amenity for neighbouring occupiers, and the alterations would not detract from the appearance of the parade or the street scene or result in conditions prejudicial to highway safety. The proposal therefore accords with adopted Unitary Development Plan policies ENV-B.1.1 (New development), H.1.4 (Housing standards and guidelines), H.6.4 (Extensions and alterations), S.2.2  (Non retail uses in other shopping areas) and T.1.4 (Car and cycle parking and servicing facilities for developments)."
  ],
